 with them and issue certificates, with the engine support, API values and constraints that apply.",{"_94":388},"platform/pqc/keys-and-cas.mdx",{"_70":390,"_77":87,"_72":59,"_81":391,"_90":-7,"_12":58,"_92":392},"en:platform/pqc/related-certificates.mdx","Bind a certificate with a post-quantum key to an existing classical certificate of the same device, following RFC 9763, and how Lamassu issues and checks them.",{"_94":393},"platform/pqc/related-certificates.mdx",{"_70":395,"_77":87,"_72":32,"_81":396,"_90":-7,"_12":31,"_92":397},"en:platform/pqc/dashboard.mdx","How the web interface exposes post-quantum algorithms when creating keys, CAs and certificates, and how it displays them.",{"_94":398},"platform/pqc/dashboard.mdx",{"_70":400,"_77":115,"_90":-7,"_72":401},"en:_9","Deployment",{"_70":403,"_77":87,"_72":62,"_81":404,"_90":-7,"_12":61,"_92":405},"en:platform/pqc/tls-front-proxy.mdx","The Traefik fork that terminates device TLS with classical and post-quantum certificates for the same host, how it picks a certificate and how it is built.",{"_94":406},"platform/pqc/tls-front-proxy.mdx",{"_70":408,"_77":87,"_72":35,"_81":409,"_90":-7,"_12":34,"_92":410},"en:platform/pqc/deployment.mdx","Deploy Lamassu with a Traefik front proxy that serves classical, post-quantum and composite certificates, using the chart values or the fast-lane installer.",{"_94":411},"platform/pqc/deployment.mdx",{"_70":413,"_77":115,"_90":-7,"_72":414},"en:_10","Integration tests",{"_70":416,"_77":87,"_72":47,"_81":417,"_90":-7,"_12":46,"_92":418},"en:platform/pqc/integration-tests/overview.mdx","Evidence that software outside Lamassu negotiates post-quantum key exchange and verifies post-quantum and composite certificates served by Lamassu.",{"_94":419},"platform/pqc/integration-tests/overview.mdx",{"_70":421,"_77":87,"_72":41,"_81":422,"_90":-7,"_12":40,"_92":423},"en:platform/pqc/integration-tests/https.mdx","Results of testing a Lamassu HTTPS endpoint with OpenSSL and curl using post-quan