-logs.mdx","Audit logs","Understand which audit events Lamassu generates and how to turn them into a durable trail.",{"_94":11},{"_70":457,"_77":87,"_72":458,"_81":459,"_90":-7,"_12":460,"_92":461},"en:platform/administration/alerts.mdx","Alerts and subscriptions","Send PKI events to people and external systems.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/platform/administration/alerts",{"_94":462},"platform/administration/alerts.mdx","en:platform/administration",{"_229":465},"platform/administration/meta.json","en:platform",{"_229":468},"platform/meta.json","<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/images/lamassu.svg\"/><img src=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/images/lamassu.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem;vertical-align:middle;flex-shrink:0;object-fit:contain\"/>",{"_77":78,"_72":401,"_79":29,"_80":-7,"_81":471,"_83":-7,"_74":472,"_70":537,"_92":538,"_90":540},"Run Lamassu in your environment",[473,480,483,489,496,503,510,513,520,523,530],{"_70":474,"_77":87,"_72":475,"_81":476,"_90":-7,"_12":477,"_92":478},"en:deployment/overview.mdx","Deploy Lamassu","Choose the operating model that fits your infrastructure and control requirements.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/deployment/overview",{"_94":479},"deployment/overview.mdx",{"_70":481,"_77":115,"_90":-7,"_72":482},"en:_12","Kubernetes self-managed",{"_70":484,"_77":87,"_72":482,"_81":485,"_90":-7,"_12":486,"_92":487},"en:deployment/self-hosted/overview.mdx","Choose an installation workflow and network architecture for Lamassu on your Kubernetes cluster.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/deployment/self-hosted/overview",{"_94":488},"deployment/self-hosted/overview.mdx",{"_70":490,"_77":87,"_72":491,"_81":492,"_90":-7,"_12":493,"_92":494},"en:deployment/self-hosted/helm.mdx","Install with Helm","Prepare dependencies, configure the Lamassu chart and verify a controlled Kubernetes deployment.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/deployment/self-hosted/helm",{"_94":495},"deployment/self-hosted/helm.mdx",{"_70":